ecycle reaches `published`.\n+\n+The register's `batches`, `records`, and `validation` fields make the finite\n+boundary inspectable without changing it: exactly four named batches, exactly\n+12 IDs in each, exactly 48 unique IDs matching `QB-A-01\u202648`, and no extra\n+record. A future editor must add card-specific evidence rather than changing a\n+default or accepting the manifest; a blocked, rejected, conflicted, withdrawn,\n+or still-pending revision remains `selectionEligible: false` with its reason.\n+\n The editorial validator must derive, rather than trust, the following report\n from published card records and their provenance/review records:\n \n\nexec\n/bin/zsh -lc \"node -e 'const fs=require(\\\"fs\\\"); const p=\\\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json\\\"; const x=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(p,\\\"utf8\\\")); const want=Array.from({length:48},(_,i)=>\"'`QB-A-${String(i+1).padStart(2,\"0\")}`); const ids=x.records.map(r=>r.cardId); const codes=Object.keys(x.pendingReasonCatalog); if(x.records.length!==48||new Set(ids).size!==48||ids.join()!==want.join()) throw Error(\"record boundary mismatch\"); if(x.batches.length!==4||x.batches.some(b=>b.cardIds.length!==12)||new Set(x.batches.flatMap(b=>b.cardIds)).size!==48) throw Error(\"batch boundary mismatch\"); if(x.records.some(r=>r.revision!==1||!r.batchId||!r.sourceFamilies.length)||x.recordDefaults.status!==\"draft\"||x.recordDefaults.selectionEligible!==false) throw Error(\"eligibility guard mismatch\"); if(x.validation.requiredPendingReasonCodes.some(c=>!codes.includes(c))) throw Error(\"reason catalog mismatch\"); if(x.recordDefaults.reviews.length!==2||new Set(x.recordDefaults.reviews.map(r=>r.role)).size!==2||x.recordDefaults.reviews.some(r=>r.decision!==\"pending\")) throw Error(\"review guard mismatch\"); console.log(\"PASS: 48 bounded draft records; 4 batches x 12; all selection-ineligible with two distinct pending review roles.\")'\"' && git diff --check && git diff --stat && git status --short\" in /Users/simon/Dev/github/jakowicz/runbook-generator\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b702df28215c7066513b94d7c5b7f21d9ad410ae\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@\n+{\n+  \"registerId\": \"QB-A-EDITORIAL-ACCEPTANCE-R1\",\n+  \"scope\": \"The existing QB-A-01 through QB-A-48 revision-1 inventory only. This register neither publishes cards nor accepts the design manifest.\",\n+  \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-03\",\n+  \"selectionRule\": \"A record is selectable only when status is published, selectionEligible is true, and every required editorial evidence item is accepted for the current revision.\",\n+  \"pendingReasonCatalog\": {\n+    \"ORIGINALITY-UNAUTHORED\": \"No player-facing prompt, instruction, options, explanation, text equivalents, or author originality record has been authored for this revision; source and reference-product expression must not be copied.\",\n+    \"PROVENANCE-LOCATOR-MISSING\": \"The source-family research route is assigned, but this revision has no exact permitted-source locator, retrieval date, factual-assertion mapping, or correction/conflict log.\",\n+    \"FACTUAL-RIGHTS-REVIEW-PENDING\": \"No distinct factual/rights-editor decision has verified the uncreated provenance and originality evidence for this revision.\",\n+    \"ACCESSIBILITY-COPY-REVIEW-PENDING\": \"No distinct accessibility/copy-editor decision has reviewed the uncreated player-facing copy, answer rule, text equivalents, and locale keys for this revision.\",\n+    \"RELEASE-GATE-INCOMPLETE\": \"The record remains draft; it has not completed fact_checked, accessibility_edited, second_reviewed, and release-editor publish tran