05\",\"revision\":1,\"sourceFamilies\":[\"PL\"]},\n+    {\"cardId\":\"QB-A-45\",\"batchId\":\"GPI-005\",\"revision\":1,\"sourceFamilies\":[\"FIFA\"]}, {\"cardId\":\"QB-A-46\",\"batchId\":\"GPI-005\",\"revision\":1,\"sourceFamilies\":[\"FIFA\"]}, {\"cardId\":\"QB-A-47\",\"batchId\":\"GPI-005\",\"revision\":1,\"sourceFamilies\":[\"FF\"]}, {\"cardId\":\"QB-A-48\",\"batchId\":\"GPI-005\",\"revision\":1,\"sourceFamilies\":[\"PL\"]}\n+  ],\n+  \"recordDefaults\": {\n+    \"status\": \"draft\",\n+    \"selectionEligible\": false,\n+    \"originalityRecord\": {\"decision\":\"pending\",\"reasonCode\":\"ORIGINALITY-UNAUTHORED\"},\n+    \"provenance\": {\"decision\":\"pending\",\"reasonCode\":\"PROVENANCE-LOCATOR-MISSING\"},\n+    \"reviews\": [\n+      {\"role\":\"factual_rights_editor\",\"decision\":\"pending\",\"reasonCode\":\"FACTUAL-RIGHTS-REVIEW-PENDING\"},\n+      {\"role\":\"accessibility_copy_editor\",\"decision\":\"pending\",\"reasonCode\":\"ACCESSIBILITY-COPY-REVIEW-PENDING\"}\n+    ],\n+    \"releaseGate\": {\"decision\":\"pending\",\"reasonCode\":\"RELEASE-GATE-INCOMPLETE\"}\n+  },\n+  \"validation\": {\n+    \"exactCardIdPattern\": \"^QB-A-(0[1-9]|[1-3][0-9]|4[0-8])$\",\n+    \"expectedRecordCount\": 48,\n+    \"expectedBatchCount\": 4,\n+    \"expectedCardsPerBatch\": 12,\n+    \"requiredPendingReasonCodes\": [\"ORIGINALITY-UNAUTHORED\",\"PROVENANCE-LOCATOR-MISSING\",\"FACTUAL-RIGHTS-REVIEW-PENDING\",\"ACCESSIBILITY-COPY-REVIEW-PENDING\",\"RELEASE-GATE-INCOMPLETE\"]\n+  }\n+}\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md\nindex 74efb681b2db104be7ad9306e868ffb8c99554d7..795de0396e0f38bb40254179724d204cfcec9038\n--- a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md\n@@ -161,6 +161,25 @@\n \n ## Mechanical release checks\n \n+## GD0002 editorial acceptance register\n+\n+[`qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json`](qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json)\n+is the durable, machine-readable ledger for all existing `QB-A-01`\u2013`QB-A-48`\n+revision-1 records. It intentionally records no fictional acceptance: every\n+record is individually listed with its existing batch and source-family route,\n+and inherits five explicit pending reasons for un-authored original expression,\n+missing resolvable provenance, each distinct review, and the incomplete release\n+transition. Its `selectionEligible: false` default is a hard audit assertion,\n+not a future promise; a selector must reject every record until current-revision\n+evidence replaces every pending item and the lifecycle reaches `published`.\n+\n+The register's `batches`, `records`, and `validation` fields make the finite\n+boundary inspectable without changing it: exactly four named batches, exactly\n+12 IDs in each, exactly 48 unique IDs matching `QB-A-01\u202648`, and no extra\n+record. A future editor must add card-specific evidence rather than changing a\n+default or accepting the manifest; a blocked, rejected, conflicted, withdrawn,\n+or still-pending revision remains `selectionEligible: false` with its reason.\n+\n The editorial validator must derive, rather than trust, the following report\n from published card records and their provenance/review records:\n \n\ncodex\n{\"status\":\"pass\",\"summary\":\"Added a durable QB-A editorial acceptance register that retains concrete pending evidence reasons for each of the 48 existing revision-1 cards and keeps every record selection-ineligible.\",\"changed_files\":[\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md\"],\"test_result\":\"PASS: node structural assertion verified exactly 48 sequential QB-A IDs, four batches of 12, draft/selection-ineligible defaults, five required pending-reason codes, and two distinct pending review roles. PASS: git diff --check.\",\"evidence\":{\"agent_log\":\"Inspected the QB-A catalogue, adjudication lifecycle, GC0001 checkpoint, inventory, and pending manifest. Added a machine-readable ledger without publishing cards or changing the manifest.\",\"adapter_log\":\"\",\"test_log\":\"PASS: 48 bounded draft records; 4 batches x 12; all selection-ineligible with two distinct pending review roles.\",\"browser_log\":\"Not applicable: editorial evidence only.\",\"screenshots\":[]},\"acceptance_results\":[{\"criterion\":\"All 48 existing QB-A card revisions have independently inspectable original-expression, provenance, and two-distinct-review evidence, or every remaining ineligible card has its exact pending or blocked reason retained.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":\"qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json individually lists QB-A-01 through QB-A-48 and records the explicit inherited pending reasons for originality, provenance, factual/rights review, accessibility/copy review, and lifecycle release gate.\"},{\"criterion\":\"The four existing batches remain finite at 12 cards each and no unreviewed record can enter selection.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":\"The register defines exactly four named batches with 12 IDs each and sets every draft record selectionEligible=false; the focused Node check verified these boundaries and guards.\"}],\"documentation\":{\"reviewed_files\":[\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/adjudication-and-freshness-bible.md\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/gc0001-coverage-checkpoint.md\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.md\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-design-manifest.json\"],\"updated_files\":[\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md\"],\"summary\":\"Documented the new durable register and its selection guard in the existing QB-A catalogue bible. The manifest was intentionally not changed.\"},\"known_limitations\":[\"No card is published or editorially accepted; each remains correctly ineligible until per-card original expression, exact provenance, and two completed distinct reviews are supplied.\"],\"browser_coverage\":\"Not applicable: this is domain-only editorial evidence with no browser-facing behavior.\",\"recommended_next_step\":\"complete\"}\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b702df28215c7066513b94d7c5b7f21d9ad410ae\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/design-evidence/qba-editorial-acceptance-register.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@\n+{\n+  \"registerId\": \"QB-A-EDITORIAL-ACCEPTANCE-R1\",\n+  \"scope\": \"The existing QB-A-01 through QB-A-48 revision-1 inventory only. This register neither publishes cards nor accepts the design manifest.\",\n+  \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-03\",\n+  \"selectionRule\": \"A record is selectable only when status is published, selectionEligible is true, and every required editorial evidence item is accepted for the current revision.\",\n+  \"pendingReasonCatalog\": {\n+    \"ORIGINALITY-UNAUTHORED\": \"No player-facing prompt, instruction, options, explanation, text equivalents, or author originality record has been authored for this revision; source and reference-product expression must not be copied.\",\n+    \"PROVENANCE-LOCATOR-MISSING\": \"The source-family research route is assigned, but this revision has no exact permitted-source locator, retrieval date, factual-assertion mapping, or correction/conflict log.\",\n+    \"FACTUAL-RIGHTS-REVIEW-PENDING\